<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Sparkteins - World of Robots</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #00c6ff, #0072ff);
      color: #fff;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    header {
      background-color: #111;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      animation: slideDown 1s ease-out;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 3em;
      color: #00ffcc;
    }

    header p {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 1.2em;
    }

    section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #ffeb3b;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out;
    }

    p {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px auto;
      animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease-out;
    }

    .robots-section {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .robot-card {
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
      animation: fadeInUp 1s ease forwards;
      opacity: 0;
      padding: 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .robot-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    .robot-card img {
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 200px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .contact-section {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      animation: fadeIn 1s ease forwards;
    }

    .contact-section h2 {
      color: #00ffcc;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .contact-section p {
      font-size: 1.1em;
    }

    .social-links a {
      margin: 0 10px;
      font-size: 1.4em;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    .social-links a:hover {
      color: #ffeb3b;
    }

    footer {
      background-color: #111;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
    }

    @keyframes slideDown {
      0% {
        transform: translateY(-30px);
        opacity: 0;
      }
      100% {
        transform: translateY(0);
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }

    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      header h1 {
        font-size: 2em;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>sparkteins</h1>
    <p>Explore the fascinating world of robots</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>Types of Robots & Their Uses</h2>
    <p>
      Robots are machines designed to carry out tasks automatically. Let's look
      at some of the main types and how they help humans in different fields.
    </p>

    <div class="robots-section">
      <div class="robot-card" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/ASIMO_front_view.jpg/300px-ASIMO_front_view.jpg" alt="Humanoid Robot" />
        <h3>Humanoid Robot</h3>
        <p>
          These robots resemble humans and are used in customer service, health care,
          and research to interact with people naturally.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="robot-card" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/industrial_robot.jpg/300px-industrial_robot.jpg" alt="Industrial Robot" />
        <h3>Industrial Robot</h3>
        <p>
          Used in factories for assembling, welding, and packaging. They increase
          efficiency and precision in manufacturing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="robot-card" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/NAO_Robot_humanoid.jpg/300px-NAO_Robot_humanoid.jpg" alt="Educational Robots" />
        <h3>Educational Robots</h3>
        <p>
          Designed to teach students about programming and robotics through interactive
          learning and activities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="robot-card" style="animation-delay: 0.8s;">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Mars_Rover.jpg/300px-Mars_Rover.jpg" alt="Exploration Robots" />
        <h3>Exploration Robots</h3>
        <p>
          Used in space, deep-sea, and dangerous environments to explore places where
          humans cannot easily go.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-section">
    <h2>Follow Us or Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For more information, contact us on <strong>08109152555</strong><br />
      or follow Sparkteins on social media:
    </p>

    <div class="social-links">
      <a href="https://facebook.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a>
      <a href="https://twitter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Twitter</a>
      <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2025 Sparkteins. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

  <script>
    window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      document.querySelectorAll('.robot-card').forEach((card, index) => {
        setTimeout(() => {
          card.style.opacity = '1';
        }, index * 200 + 400);
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
